@startuml
title StateMachine Decision (derived, not persisted)

[*] --> AtomicRepositoryResult

AtomicRepositoryResult --> EXECUTE : ACQUIRED / RECOVERY_ACQUIRED
AtomicRepositoryResult --> REPLAY : SUCCESS
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_PROCESSING : PROCESSING_ACTIVE
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_EXPIRED : PROCESSING_EXPIRED
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_FAILED : FAILED_RETRYABLE / FAILED_FINAL
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_CONFLICT : KEY_CONFLICT
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_ERROR : PROVIDER_ERROR
AtomicRepositoryResult --> RETURN_STALE : STALE_CANDIDATE

note right of AtomicRepositoryResult
Repository CAS/Lua happens BEFORE this state machine.
The state machine interprets atomic results;
it does not provide mutual exclusion.
end note
@enduml
